			(property "Description" "Header 1 Standard 1-pin 0.1\" header. Use with straight break away headers (SKU : PRT-00116), right angle break away headers (PRT-00553), swiss pins (PRT-00743), machine pins (PRT-00117), and female headers (PRT-00115). SMTSO-256-ET is a \"flush mount\" nut for a 4-40 screw. The older package used to be too tight, and did not allow it to sit properly thru the drill hit. The latest (0.165DIA) fits nice and snug."
